{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Open cladding remediation funding for under-11m blocks with \"Medium Risk\" FRAEW",
        "additional_details": "Under-11m buildings are excluded from cladding funding if an FRAEW (Fire Risk Appraisal of External Walls) report says \"no action required\". However, many insurers are using \"medium risk\" wording in these reports to justify huge premium spikes. Leaseholders can consequently face financial ruin. The Government must bridge this gap and fund risk elimination.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to extend the Cladding Safety Scheme & statutory cost protections to fully fund remediation for all residential buildings under 11 metres where a Fire Risk Appraisal of External Walls identifies medium or medium-high risk, even if the report concludes: no action required.",
